          "value": "<p dir=\"ltr\">(Column 1: division by 12)</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">(top lost: 1, 2, 3, and 4 \u00f7 12)</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">1\u00a0 \u00a05 (\u00f7 12) = \u2153 [1/]1[2]</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">2\u00a0 \u00a06 (\u00f7 12) = \u00bd</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">3\u00a0 \u00a07 (\u00f7 12) = \u00bd [1/12]</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">4\u00a0 \u00a0[8] (\u00f7 12) =\u00a0[\u2154]</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">5\u00a0 \u00a09 (\u00f7 12) =\u00a0\u00bd \u00bc</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">6\u00a0 \u00a010 (\u00f7 12) =\u00a0\u00bd \u2153</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">7\u00a0 \u00a020 (\u00f7 12) =\u00a01\u2154</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">8\u00a0 \u00a030 (\u00f7 12) = 2\u00bd</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">9\u00a0 \u00a040 (\u00f7 12) =\u00a03\u2153</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">10\u00a0 50 (\u00f7 12) =\u00a04\u2159</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">11\u00a0 [60] (\u00f7 12) =\u00a05</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">12\u00a0 70 (\u00f7 12) =\u00a05\u00bd [\u2153]</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">13\u00a0 80 (\u00f7 12) =\u00a06\u2154</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">14\u00a0 90 (\u00f7 12) =\u00a07\u00bd</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">15\u00a0 100 (\u00f7 12) =\u00a08\u2153</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">(Column 2: division by 12)</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">(top lost: 200\u2013800 \u00f7 12)</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">1\u00a0 \u00a0900 (\u00f7 12) =\u00a0[75]</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">2\u00a0 \u00a01,000 (\u00f7 12) = 8[3\u2153]</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">3\u00a0 \u00a02,000 (\u00f7 12) = [166\u2154]</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">4\u00a0 \u00a03,000 (\u00f7 12) =\u00a0250</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">5\u00a0 \u00a04,000 (\u00f7 12) = 333\u2153</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">6\u00a0 \u00a05,000 (\u00f7 12) = 416\u2154</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">7\u00a0 \u00a06,000 (\u00f7 12) =\u00a0500</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">8\u00a0 \u00a07,000 (\u00f7 12) = 583\u2153</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">9\u00a0 \u00a08,000 (\u00f7 12) =\u00a0666\u2154</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">10\u00a0 9,000 (\u00f7 12) =\u00a0750</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">11\u00a0 10,000 (\u00f7 12) = 833\u2153</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">(Arabic note after column:) according to the two q\u012br\u0101\u1e6ds</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">(Column 3: division by 24)</p>\